+User Management Migration Requirements
+**************************************
+
+The controlling node utilizes values found in the :ref:`application_command_class_definitions-user_credential_command_class_version_1-user_capabilities_report_command` and the :ref:`application_command_class_definitions-user_code_command_class_version_2-user_code_capabilities_report_command` to determine which command class is used by the supporting node for user management.
