+  \requirement{CC:0086.04.00.01.002}{0}
+
+To ensure backwards compatibility with older controllers, when a migration operation with ID 0x01 or 0x02 completes successfully, a :ref:`application_command_class_definitions-user_code_command_class_version_1-users_number_report_command` and a :ref:`application_command_class_definitions-user_credential_command_class_version_1-user_capabilities_report_command` MUST be sent to the Lifeline.
